{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_52","type":"agent_message","text":"Formal exposed an important side effect: the datapath skipped the false stall correctly, but RVFI was still reporting raw non-source register fields. The old conservative stall had been hiding that for `rs2`; I’m going to gate RVFI source address/data reporting by the retiring instruction’s opcode so unused fields retire as zero."}}
