{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_15","type":"agent_message","text":"I’m going to add the address field to the packed EX/MEM bundle, expose the ALU add sum as a named sideband, and then switch every memory-facing consumer over to that lane. That keeps forwarding behavior intact while making memory ops stop carrying their address in the general result field."}}
