{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"agent_message","text":"The stall phase is exactly documented: seed `0xDEADBEEF`, two xorshift draws per cycle, imem first, accept on low 7 bits `< 100`. I’m going to mirror only the imem half in fetch and compare it against the real pin each cycle, so a wrong phase drops back to the old handshake behavior."}}
