longer pass through the jump-link mux.\"\n  - file: rtl/wb_stage.sv\n    description: \"Select PC+4 for JAL/JALR register writeback in the final WB mux, before the existing load-vs-ALU choice, while preserving x0 gating through w_en/w_addr.\"\n  - file: test/test_jump_link.py\n    description: \"Add focused coverage for JAL and JALR link writes, dependent use through MEM/WB forwarding, x0 link suppression, and misaligned jump traps clearing reg_write.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
