MEM register.\"\n  - file: rtl/core_pkg.sv\n    description: \"Add any small control metadata needed to identify divide-class ALU operations cleanly without widening unrelated pipeline state.\"\n  - file: rtl/hazard_unit.sv\n    description: \"Add a divide-busy stall input so IF/ID/EX are held consistently while the iterative unit finishes.\"\n  - file: rtl/div_unit.sv\n    description: \"Add a compact signed/unsigned restoring divider that implements RV32M divide-by-zero and INT_MIN/-1 corner cases.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
