ion: \"Gate load-use detection with the explicit fetch-valid/kill inputs and keep redirect/load-use/dmem/div stall priority behavior identical.\"\n  - file: rtl/if_stage.sv\n    description: \"Leave the ID-facing NOP-on-flush behavior intact, but remove it from the hazard-unit timing dependency where possible.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
