1 contract.\"\n  - file: rtl/alu.sv\n    description: \"Reduce the main ALU to fast RV32I operations only, preserving the RISCV_FORMAL_ALTOPS behavior for any M results moved to the new unit.\"\n  - file: rtl/muldiv_unit.sv\n    description: \"Add a dedicated multi-cycle RV32M execution unit for MUL/MULH/MULHU/MULHSU/DIV/DIVU/REM/REMU with RV32M edge-case semantics.\"\n  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n    description: \"Route M-extension instructions through the mul/div unit, hold the EX/MEM register until the result is ready, and keep branch/load/store/common ALU operations on the short path.\"\n  - file: rtl/hazard_unit.sv\n    description: \"Add EX busy handling so IF and ID stall cleanly during a multi-cycle M operation while redirects and dmem stalls retain their existing priority.\"\n  - file: rtl/core.sv\n    description: \"Wire the new EX busy signal into hazard control and instantiate any additional execute-stage support while preserving all existing IO ports.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
