lush control.\"\n  - file: rtl/core.sv\n    description: \"Wire the revised IF payload flush control separately from the redirect PC control while preserving the nret=1 top-level IO and RVFI contract.\"\n  - file: rtl/id_stage.sv\n    description: \"Rely on the existing ID/EX flush to squash redirected wrong-path payloads, with no new pipeline register or retirement behavior change.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
