t routed through the full ALU mux.\"\n  - file: rtl/core_pkg.sv\n    description: \"Add compact execute result-class metadata if needed to distinguish LSU address-lane results from general ALU and jump-link results without widening unrelated state.\"\n  - file: test/test_pipeline.py\n    description: \"Add focused coverage for forwarded base-register LOAD/STORE/JALR cases to prove the new address lane preserves existing forwarding and redirect behavior.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
